<h2 id="-what-will-you-get">✨ What will you get?</h2>

<h3 id="-ai-foundation-awareness">🧠 AI Foundation Awareness</h3>

<ul>
  <li>Core AI concepts</li>
  <li>Healthcare scenarios</li>
  <li>Medical data characteristics and challenges</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="-core-machine-learning-methods">🤖 Core machine learning methods</h3>

<ul>
  <li>Decision Tree</li>
  <li>Logistic regression</li>
  <li>Support Vector Machine (SVM)</li>
  <li>Neural Networks / Deep Learning</li>
  <li>Integrated Learning Models</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="-frontier-exploration-of-ai-in-healthcare">🔬 Frontier exploration of AI in healthcare</h3>

<ul>
  <li>Clinical Natural Language Processing (Clinical NLP)</li>
  <li>Generative AI in the biomedical field</li>
  <li>Deep Modeling for Medical Imaging</li>
  <li>AI-assisted clinical decision making</li>
</ul>

<h3 id="️-limitations-and-challenges-of-medical-ai">⚠️ Limitations and Challenges of Medical AI</h3>

<ul>
  <li>Data bias and fairness issues</li>
  <li>Lack of interpretability</li>
  <li>Deployment risks</li>
  <li>Medical Ethics and Regulation</li>
</ul>

