<ul>
  <li>Combine theory (AI / Machine Learning / Deep Learning) with real-world medical / biomedical case studies - to help understand the application and challenges of AI in real medical scenarios.</li>
  <li>Collaboration with experienced faculty - Faculty members have AI research background (Prof. Wu) as well as clinical experience and primary care background (Dr. Jani), which is conducive to the understanding of healthcare AI from a multi-dimensional perspective.</li>
  <li>Short-term (two weeks) intensive learning + credits - very friendly for those who want to try out the healthcare + AI intersection but have limited time.</li>
</ul>

